{"id":"268507","name":"菜谱","author":"芋儿烘焙","authorId":"6248544","desc":"","cover":"images/268507/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"500克"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"几粒"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"半瓶"},{"name":"盐","amount":"四分之一袋"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"100克"},{"name":"红萝卜","amount":"10斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"味精","amount":"100克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料准备。","img":"images/268507/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"萝卜洗净，切条，放入四分之一袋盐，腌制24小时。","img":"images/268507/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜切碎，小米辣切碎备用。","img":"images/268507/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"小时后，挤水，将蒜末放入。","img":"images/268507/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将小米辣加入萝卜里面。","img":"images/268507/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入白糖。","img":"images/268507/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入白醋，一起搅拌均匀。","img":"images/268507/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌好的泡菜，放洗净的坛子里，密封好。第二天就可以吃了。","img":"images/268507/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品欣赏。","img":"images/268507/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品欣赏。","img":"images/268507/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品欣赏。","img":"images/268507/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品欣赏。","img":"images/268507/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}